@startuml Activity Diagram - Receive Response (Customer)

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam activityPadding 6
skinparam activityMargin 6
skinparam arrowThickness 1
skinparam notePadding 4
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

|Database|
start

|Database|
:(1) Push response (AI or human) via notification;

|System|
:(2) Receive response (stream or full);
:(3) Show typing/streaming indicator while receiving;
:(4) Display final message in chat;
:(5) Acknowledge receipt (optional);
:(6) View response;
stop

@enduml